.zig-cache/
zig-out/
*.o

# KiCad per-user local state and backups (project + schematic are tracked)
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
*.kicad_sch-bak
fp-info-cache

# Build output exported by `dagger call artifacts ... export --path=./artifacts`
/artifacts/

# bossac 1.7.0, fetched per the blinky README; a vendor binary, not source.
# MUST stay anchored with a leading slash: a bare `bossac` also matches
# daggerverse/bossac/, which silently drops that toolchain from Dagger's
# module context and breaks `dagger call bossac sam-ba` in CI.
/bossac
